OccupiedLength [SimTalk] - lane A or B
Returns the part of the entire length of the specified lane of the TwoLaneTrack designated by <Path> which
is occupied by all Transporters located on it.
Remarks
Each Transporter located on the TwoLaneTrack occupies part of the entire available length on the
TwoLaneTrack.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.A.OccupiedLength → length
<Path>.B.OccupiedLength → length
Return Value
The return value has the data type length.
Example
print myTwoLaneTrack.A.OccupiedLength
See also
Length [text box] - lane A
Length [text box] - lane B
