BwEntranceCtrl [SimTalk] - lane A or B
Designates a Method object of the object designated by <Path>.
Remarks
Plant Simulation calls the Method when a Transporter enters the specified lane of the TwoLaneTrack
designated by <Path> via its exit and/or when the Transporter moves toward its entrance after entering.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.A.BwEntranceCtrl:method
<Path>.B.BwEntranceCtrl:method
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type method.
Example
MyTwoLaneTrack.B.BwEntranceCtrl := &MyBackwardEntranceMethod
See also
Backward Entrance Control
