Length [SimTalk] - lane A or B
Sets the physical length of the specified lane of the TwoLaneTrack designated by <Path>.
Remarks
A Transporter enters the specified lane of the TwoLaneTrack at position 0 and exits after covering the
length you enter here. Speed and Length yield the dwelling time on the TwoLaneTrack.
Type
Attribute
Syntax
<Path>.A.Length:length
<Path>.B.Length:length
Watchable
The attribute is watchable.
Assignment Value
You can assign a value of data type length.
Example
MyTwoLaneTrack.A.Length := 44    // meters
MyTwoLaneTrack.B.Length := 43.8  // meters
